rming cafe--and the waiter who greets him is Prince Licht's spitting image! Is Licht's secret still safe, or is he in big trouble with the king?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/utxUT9fVqOwtNRwmN7Gy4zgH9JS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"When he was a sickly child, Licht was always waiting in his bed for a certain person to visit... While strolling about the city one day, Heine steps inside a charming cafe--and the waiter who greets him is Prince Licht's spitting image! Is Licht's secret still safe, or is he in big trouble with the king?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/utxUT9fVqOwtNRwmN7Gy4zgH9JS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12485","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97932","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34262","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71008","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"325373","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"47417","synopsis":"From a young age, Prince Bruno has poured his utmost efforts into his studies to catch up with the crown prince who everyone saw as a genius. So when little brother Leonhard shows signs of genius, too--however unbelievable that may be--he panics. Can Heine help the brainiac prince decide what he really wants out of life?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/psyfGXNGFMjMWKg5ApcIDauLwMU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"From a young age, Prince Bruno has poured his utmost efforts into his studies to catch up with the crown prince who everyone saw as a genius. So when little brother Leonhard shows signs of genius, too--however unbelievable that may be--he panics. Can Heine help the brainiac prince decide what he really wants out of life?","thumb